Para.Text:
“CCTS” means the Non-Zero-Emission Car CO2 Trading Scheme, established by article 4
                                       (1)
                                       (b);

“CCTS participant” means a manufacturer which is a CCTS participant in accordance with article 32
                                       (1) or a group of manufacturers which is a pool CCTS participant in accordance with article 32
                                       (2);

“CRTS” means the Non-Zero-Emission Car Registration Trading Scheme, established by article 4
                                       (1)
                                       (a);

“CRTS participant” means a manufacturer which is a CRTS participant in accordance with article 11
                                       (1) or a group of manufacturers which is a pool CRTS participant in accordance with article 11
                                       (2);

“VCTS” means the Non-Zero-Emission Van CO2 Trading Scheme, established by article 4
                                       (1)
                                       (d);

“VCTS participant” means a manufacturer which is a participant in the VCTS in accordance with article 64
                                       (1) or a group of manufacturers which is a pool VCTS participant in accordance with article 64
                                       (2);

“VRTS” means the Non-Zero-Emission Van Registration Trading Scheme, established by article 4
                                       (1)
                                       (c);

“VRTS participant” means a manufacturer which is a participant in the VRTS in accordance with article 43
                                       (1) or a group of manufacturers which is a pool participant in the VRTS in accordance with article 43
                                       (2);

P3para.Text:
for the scheme year for which the administrator is satisfied that a ZE van or ZE SPV mentioned in paragraph (1)
                                       (a) is not being, or has not been, used in accordance with paragraph (1)
                                       (b); or

the number of units of activity in the CRTS and any additional matters for which the participant must account for that scheme year in accordance with article 27
                                    (1)
                                    (b) or (c) (car club credits and borrowed CRTS allowances);

the number of units of activity in the VRTS and any additional matters for which the participant must account for that scheme year in accordance with article 59
                                    (1)
                                    (b) or (c) (car club credits and borrowed VRTS allowances);

P4para.Text:
the number of credits acquired by the participant under each of article 19
                                          (1), 19
                                          (2), 20, 51 and 52;

the number of credits acquired by the SPV manufacturer under each of articles 21
                                          (1), 21
                                          (2), 22, 53 and 54;

P3para.Text:
article 73
(5)
(a) to (d) (SPVs, car clubs and ZE car or van warranties);

paragraph 1
                                    (i) or 6
                                    (k) of Schedule 7 (fuel type and fuel mode of a car, van or SPV);

paragraph 1
                                    (l) or 6
                                    (n) of Schedule 7 (code for any eco-innovations);

Para.Text:
“revocations” means the revocations effected by article 110
                                       (1) and article 113
                                       (1);
